{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10131210","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10131210","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1013121001:0":{"text":"음... 여러분은 골렘의 흔적을 쫓아 이곳까지 온 거군요?","source_cn":"唔……原来你们是追查魔偶踪迹来到这里的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F4CE5089D430201","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1013121002:0":{"text":"여러분을 조금 더 일찍 만났더라면, 다들 이렇게 고향을 떠나지 않았을 텐데...","source_cn":"你们要是早点来就好了，大伙就不至于背井离乡了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9436C1FF509F482F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1013121003:0":{"text":"메린 양, 골렘들이 근방에서 소란을 피운 지 오래되었나요?","source_cn":"梅瑞特小姐，魔偶在附近作乱很久了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E0E483A0D7AECE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1013121004:0":{"text":"예전에는 마을 사람들한테서 저 멀리 산에 골렘이 내려온다는 이야기를 전해 듣기만 했는데... 정말 골렘을 본 건 최근의 일이에요.","source_cn":"先前只是听村里的人说远处的山上有魔偶下来，真正见到它们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x623D782FFA473469","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:梅瑞特":{"text":"메린","source":"梅瑞特","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:特弥希娅":{"text":"테미히아","source":"特弥希娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}